  28:     smallest side length, treat that one smallest square as a distractor and do
  29:     not count it. For count rank k from left to right, create one block from all
  30:     square sizes with at least k remaining objects; draw larger squares first and
  31:     smaller squares over their upper-left corner, then append one background
  32:     separator column.
  33: 
